value="4  공동 상태 갱신" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="154" y="1010" width="171.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" value="5  명령/질문 제안" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="129" y="1530" width="171.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="전이 작성자는 중앙 하나&lt;br&gt;Task별 cache/선택 갱신 가능&lt;br&gt;모든 Task를 직렬 실행하지 않음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="854" y="1360" width="327.2" height="87.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="추론: Request Interpreter → Model Access → 같은 Omni → 의미 결과 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="94" y="1810" width="855.98" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="유리: 업무 간 생략/교차 참조를 한 번에 해석&lt;br&gt;대가: 중앙이 모든 대화 전이 규칙을 관리&lt;br&gt;선택: 짧고 서로 얽힌 업무 대화" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="79" y="2125" width="527.34" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="B  업무별 처리자가 상태를 제안" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="285" width="479.6" height="46.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="같은 발화 + 보고서/메일의 질문과 실제 전달 기록" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1342" y="350" width="524.18" height="34.35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e39" value="1  원문/입력 버전" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1737" y="520" width="171.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e41" value="2  원문 / 3  교환한 참조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1387" y="865" width="245.6" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e43" value="3  절/다음 상태/제공 또는 필요한 참조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1387" y="950" width="360.44" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e45" value="5  채택 통지 후 상태 반영" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1387" y="1360" width="248.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="이전 상태" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1617" y="1420" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e49" value="2  원문 / 3  교환한 참조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1972" y="865" width="245.6" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e51" value="3  절/다음 상태/제공 또는 필요한 참조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1972" y="950" width="360.44" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e53" value="5  채택 통지 후 상태 반영" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1972" y="1360" width="248.12" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e55" value="이전 상태" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2202" y="1420" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e59" value="4  현재 검사 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1357" y="655" width="171.8" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" value="허용/거절" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1662" y="655" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e63" value="5  상태/intent 원자 확정" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1962" y="655" width="249.92" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e65" value="저장 성공" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2292" y="655" width="91.16" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e66" value="3  보고서 참조는 Coordinator의 반환/전달 경로로 메일 actor에 제공" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1660" width="722.8" height="33.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e69" value="자기 맥락으로 해석 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1347" y="1770" width="221.48" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e71" value="자기 의미 결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1347" y="1930" width="138.32" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e73" value="자기 맥락으로 해석 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2167" y="1770" width="221.48" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e75" value="자기 의미 결과" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2172" y="1930" width="138.32" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e76" value="추론은 Model Access/공유 Omni. Coordinator는 actor의 다음 상태를 다시 작성하지 않음." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="2000" width="906.32" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e78" value="유리: 업무별 대화 규칙/사건 처리를 해당 actor가 소유&lt;br&gt;대가: 참가 누락/제안 충돌/참조 왕복/모델 경합&lt;br&gt;선택: 독립적으로 오래 이어지는 여러 업무" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1327" y="2125" width="644.64" height="123" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e79" value="공통 마무리: Request Controller 현재 검사 → Task Manager → Agent Gateway → Downstream Agent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2270" width="1201.72" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e80" value="접수/결과 반환 → Response Manager → Interaction Manager의 실제 표시/음성. 미해결이면 실행 대신 질문." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2310" width="1245.28" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e81" value="검정: 공통 / 파랑: A 고유 / 초록: B 고유. 실선: 요청/전달 / 점선: 결과. 네모: 이름 / 원통: 상태 / 육각형: 외부 의존." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2370" width="1205.76" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e82" value="같은 이름의 반복 상자는 동일 Component. 비교 부분의 책임을 펼친 그림. 별도 process 표기가 없으면 논리 분해. 모델 가중치는 한 벌; 이익은 조건부 설계 가설, 미측정." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2410" width="1644.66" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
